# The wide frame: an agent's video right clicked and quoted (MBUI_FIXTURE=chat-download), sent with no words: its still
# grows from its tile in the quote's card in the composer to its box in the message's card (sfpages composer.mbt
# flying_quotes, sfbase flight.mbt). MBUI_WIN=1280x800 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=0.
timeout 20000
until 演示录屏.mp4
wait 600
rightclick 演示录屏.mp4
wait 400
tap 引用
wait 900
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1500
exit
